---
import { ArrowLeft, Upload, RefreshCw } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><title>专辑多文件上传 | Station Cat</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-music.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-music-batch.css" /></head>
<body class="music-admin"><header class="music-topbar"><a href="/admin/music/collections/"><ArrowLeft size={18} />返回专辑工作区</a><span>Station Cat / 后台</span></header>
<main class="music-shell">
  <header class="music-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">专辑 · 多文件上传</p><h1 id="batch-album-title">正在核对专辑…</h1></div><span class="badge">仅创建草稿</span></header>
  <div class="music-health"><span id="batch-quota">正在读取配额…</span><span>一首完成后，再处理下一首</span></div>
  <div class="music-feedback"><p id="batch-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在载入…</p><button id="batch-reload" type="button" aria-label="重新核对"><RefreshCw size={18} /></button></div>
  <section id="batch-setup" class="music-workspace" aria-label="选择专辑文件">
    <h2>选择这张专辑的完整音频</h2><p class="muted">每批最多 50 首、文件合计不超过 1 GiB。MP3 每首最多 32 MiB；WAV 每首最多 256 MiB、20 分钟，在本机转换后上传。</p>
    <form id="batch-form"><fieldset id="batch-fields" disabled><div class="field-grid"><label>原文语言<select id="batch-locale"><option value="zh-Hans">简体中文</option><option value="zh-Hant">繁體中文</option><option value="en">English</option><option value="ja">日本語</option></select></label><label>创作者署名<input id="batch-creator" maxlength="80" required /></label><label>歌曲语言<input id="batch-language" maxlength="40" required placeholder="例如：中文／无人声" /></label><label class="check"><input id="batch-instrumental" type="checkbox" />这些曲目均为器乐</label></div>
    <label>选择 MP3 或 WAV 文件<input id="batch-files" type="file" accept=".mp3,.wav" multiple required /></label>
    <button type="submit" class="primary"><Upload size={18} />生成上传清单</button><p class="muted">此步不上传。下一步可调整曲名和顺序，并逐首确认免费或 VIP。</p></fieldset></form>
  </section>
  <section id="batch-workspace" class="music-workspace" aria-label="上传清单" hidden>
    <header class="workspace-heading"><h2>上传清单</h2><span id="batch-summary" class="badge"></span></header>
    <p class="notice">上传成功后仍是未发布草稿。试听、封面、歌词与权利材料需在曲目工作区补齐并逐首审核。</p>
    <p id="batch-recovery-note" class="muted">文件只保留在本机。刷新后清单会恢复，但不会自动上传；需要时请在对应行重选原文件。</p>
    <ol id="batch-rows"></ol>
    <div id="batch-progress" hidden><label id="batch-progress-label" for="batch-meter"></label><progress id="batch-meter" max="100"></progress></div>
    <footer class="batch-actions"><button id="batch-start" type="button" class="primary">确认并开始上传</button><button id="batch-stop" type="button" hidden>停止后续／取消转换</button><button id="batch-retry" type="button" hidden>核对并重试原操作</button><button id="batch-add" type="button">将成功曲目加入专辑</button><button id="batch-sync-album" type="button">核对服务器曲序</button><button id="batch-cancel-remaining" type="button">取消未开始项</button><button id="batch-clear" type="button">结束此批次</button></footer>
    <p class="muted">停止后续不会撤回已发送的上传。失败时保留原会话和额度；未确认的上传不能通过新建预留绕过。</p>
  </section>
  <p class="muted batch-license">WAV 转码使用同源本机组件。<a href="/vendor/music-mp3/NOTICE.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">编码器许可与源代码</a></p>
</main>
<dialog id="batch-confirm"><form method="dialog"><h2 id="batch-confirm-title"></h2><p id="batch-confirm-text"></p><footer class="music-actions"><button value="cancel">取消</button><button value="yes" id="batch-confirm-accept" class="primary">确认</button></footer></form></dialog>
<script>import '../../../../../scripts/adminMusicAlbumBatch.js';</script>
</body></html>
